# SSSF environment. Copy to .env at the repo root ONLY if you need an override below.
#
# The PMO roster (adws/adw_sssf_config/sssf.config.yaml) runs entirely on providers that
# authenticate through pi itself — zai (GLM) and openai-codex (OAuth) — so NO provider API
# keys belong in this file. If `pi --list-models` shows both providers, you are done.
#
# ⚠ Repo is PUBLIC and `.env` is gitignored — never commit a real .env, never put secrets
# here. Secret handling rules: docs/environments.md.

# Optional overrides
# PI_PATH=pi                       # pi binary if not on PATH
# PI_MODELS_PATH=~/.pi/agent/models.json
# ENGINEER_NAME=                   # engineer lane label, defaults to git user.name
